# shapes

## Forms

### `(canvas …)`

Drawing surface. Positional children are shapes.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:w` | `number` | no | — | — |
| `:h` | `number` | no | — | — |
| `:bg` | `string` | no | — | Named background colour ("black", "#202028", …). |

Positional children: any.

### `(circle …)`

Filled circle at :center with given :radius.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:center` | `vector<any>` | no | — | — |
| `:radius` | `number` | no | — | — |
| `:fill` | `symbol enum` | no | — | one of: `evenodd`, `nonzero`<br>Optional :evenodd or :nonzero fill rule. |

### `(rect …)`

Axis-aligned rectangle from :origin spanning :size.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:origin` | `vector<any>` | no | — | — |
| `:size` | `vector<any>` | no | — | — |

### `(group …)`

Named container of shapes; positional children are shapes.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `string` | no | — | — |

Positional children: any.

### `(scene …)`

Top-level scene. `open = true` so authors can attach ad-hoc metadata keywords without the validator complaining.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:title` | `string` | no | — | — |

Positional children: any.

Open form: unknown keys are accepted.

### `(badge …)`

Tiny labelled mark. `:shape` is HeadSet-pinned: only `(circle …)` or `(rect …)` are accepted as the focal form.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:label` | `string` | no | — | — |
| `:shape` | `form: (circle …) \| (rect …)` | no | — | — |

## Value kinds

### length

Non-negative scalar in canvas units.

Type: `number`.

### point

[x y] vector in canvas coordinates.

Type: `vector<any>`.

### fill-rule

SVG-style fill rule. One of `evenodd` or `nonzero`.

Type: `symbol enum` — one of: `evenodd`, `nonzero`.

### shape-form

Form-as-slot: `(circle …)` or `(rect …)`. Used by `(badge :shape …)` to pin the focal element's identity.

Type: `form: (circle …) | (rect …)`.

## Expression functions

| Function | Signature | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `golden` | `(golden)` | Golden ratio (placeholder). Declared so the validator recognises it; evaluator dispatch lands with v0.3 plugin hooks. |
| `deg` | `(deg _)` | Degrees → radians. Declared; not yet evaluable. |
